# No credentials, private state, dependencies or backups enter the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/private
**/secrets
**/keys
**/backups
**/backup
**/*key*
**/*secret*
**/*ufvk*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.dump
**/*.backup
**/*.sql
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.log
**/*.tar*
**/*.zip
**/coverage
**/dist
**/.cache
**/reports
